---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// Dynamic (not prerendered) because BaseLayout's nav/footer depend on
// live per-request session and locale state via Astro.cookies.
export const prerender = false;

const lastUpdated = '19 September 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — IWIS Global" description="How IWIS Global collects, uses, and protects your information when you book a tour or create an account.">
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-xs text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 mb-8">
      This page is a starting draft describing how this website actually handles data, based on its real
      functionality. It has not been reviewed by a lawyer and should not be treated as final legal advice —
      please have it reviewed before relying on it for compliance purposes (e.g. GDPR for EU visitors).
    </p>

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold mb-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mb-6">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-6">
      IWIS Global ("we", "us") operates this website to sell private Agra and Taj Mahal tours. This policy
      explains what information we collect when you use it, and how it's used.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Information we collect</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-stone-700 space-y-1 mb-6">
      <li><strong>Booking details:</strong> when you book a tour, we collect your name, email address, and phone number, along with your chosen tour, travel date, and traveler count.</li>
      <li><strong>Payment:</strong> payments are processed by Razorpay. We never see or store your card, UPI, or bank details — Razorpay handles that directly, and we only receive confirmation that a payment succeeded.</li>
      <li><strong>Account information (optional):</strong> if you sign in with Google or Apple, we receive your name, email address, and (for Google) profile photo from that provider, so you can view your booking history.</li>
      <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> your chosen language and currency are stored in cookies on your device so the site remembers them on your next visit.</li>
      <li><strong>Contact via WhatsApp or email:</strong> if you message us on WhatsApp or by email, that conversation is governed by WhatsApp's (Meta's) or your email provider's own privacy practices, not this policy.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">How we use this information</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-stone-700 space-y-1 mb-2">
      <li>To process and confirm your booking, and to contact you about it.</li>
      <li>To let you sign in and view your booking history, if you create an account.</li>
      <li>To respond to questions you send us.</li>
      <li>To meet legal and accounting obligations (e.g. retaining payment records).</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-6">We do not sell your personal information, and we do not run advertising trackers or analytics scripts on this site.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Who we share it with</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-stone-700 space-y-1 mb-2">
      <li><strong>Razorpay</strong> — to process payments.</li>
      <li><strong>Google / Apple</strong> — only if you choose to sign in with them.</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — our hosting and database provider; your requests pass through their infrastructure to reach our servers.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-6">We don't share your information with anyone else for marketing purposes.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Cookies</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-2">This site uses a small number of cookies, all for functionality rather than tracking or advertising:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-stone-700 space-y-1 mb-6">
      <li><code class="text-sm bg-stone-100 px-1 rounded">currency</code> and <code class="text-sm bg-stone-100 px-1 rounded">lang</code> — remember your preferred currency and language.</li>
      <li><code class="text-sm bg-stone-100 px-1 rounded">customer_session</code> — keeps you signed in, if you have an account.</li>
      <li><code class="text-sm bg-stone-100 px-1 rounded">admin_session</code> — staff-only, used to access the booking management system.</li>
      <li><code class="text-sm bg-stone-100 px-1 rounded">oauth_state</code> — a short-lived cookie used only during Google/Apple sign-in, deleted immediately after.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Data retention</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-6">We keep booking records for as long as needed for accounting, legal, and customer-support purposes. You can ask us to delete your account and associated personal data by contacting us — see below.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Your choices</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-6">
      You can book a tour as a guest without creating an account. If you do sign in, you can stop using that
      account at any time, and can ask us to delete your data by contacting us.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Contact us</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700">
      Questions about this policy or your data can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:info@iwisglobal.com" class="text-brand-800 hover:underline">info@iwisglobal.com</a> or via
      <a href="https://wa.me/916399226633" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-800 hover:underline">WhatsApp</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
